  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Compounds that contain at least one benzene ring in their structure are called benzenoid compounds.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0ae6209c-0da9-4542-9f76-2437e511e220-9756182_Solution.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 173px;\" /></p><p>The above compounds are benzenoid compounds due to the presence of benzene ring.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/82df1963-007c-4958-b36c-65f2ae27a3e5-image.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px;\" />Cycloocta-1,3,5,7-tetraene&nbsp;is non aromatic beacause of its tub shaped structure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
